  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The correct answer is <math alttext=\"18\"><mn>18</mn>\n</math>. Subtracting <math alttext=\"45\"><mn>45</mn>\n</math> from each side of the given equation yields <math alttext=\"StartAbsoluteValue x minus 9 EndAbsoluteValue equals 18\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math>. By the definition of absolute value, if <math alttext=\"StartAbsoluteValue x minus 9 EndAbsoluteValue equals 18\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math>, then <math alttext=\"x minus 9 equals 18\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>18</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math> or <math alttext=\"x minus 9 equals negative 18\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Adding <math alttext=\"9\"><mn>9</mn>\n</math> to each side of the equation <math alttext=\"x minus 9 equals 18\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>18</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"x equals 27\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>27</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Adding <math alttext=\"9\"><mn>9</mn>\n</math> to each side of the equation <math alttext=\"x minus 9 equals negative 18\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"x equals negative 9\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Therefore, the solutions to the given equation are <math alttext=\"27\"><mn>27</mn>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"negative 9\"><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn>\n</math>, and it follows that the sum of the solutions to the given equation is <math alttext=\"27 plus left parenthesis negative 9 right parenthesis\"><mn>27</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, or <math alttext=\"18\"><mn>18</mn>\n</math>.</p>",
